{"data":[{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T20:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115534064937468133"],"id":"2115534064937468133","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":57,"impression_count":70462,"like_count":300,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":45,"retweet_count":30},"text":"带娃上班，孩子躺在地上：评论区也纷纷晒图感叹“小孩没带好，钱没挣到”\n\n近日，一名母亲在抖音分享带娃上班的视频：孩子躺在堆放货物的地面上。她配文：“等上学了，咱就好了，妈妈就负责赚钱养你……”\n评论区，多名网友也晒出相似照片：有孩子躺在水磨石地面上，也有孩子躺在铺开的纸板上。 https://t.co/0V4H0YxNzR","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115534064937468133"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:58:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115533748934676601"],"id":"2115533748934676601","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12226,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":3},"text":"川普：“你说过去7个月里，你们生产了更多的石油，产出了更多的各类产品，赚到的钱也比以往任何时候都多。知道为什么吗？7个月前发生了什么？战争。可每当我这么说，他们就惊呼：‘噢，这太糟糕了。’但实际上，我们正在赚取巨额财富。”","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2115533748934676601"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:50:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115531563077349587"],"id":"2115531563077349587","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11121,"like_count":30,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"川普在得州拉票：“所以我察看他。我犯了个错，说我一开始是先盯着他的屁股看。后来，我又看了看他的脚，那双脚大得惊人。那些假新闻只盯着屁股那部分做文章。他们说，川普到底在干什么？怎么谈起男人的身体部位来了？他居然在谈论他的屁股。我研究他的屁股，是为了看看他的力量究竟是从哪儿来的。”","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2115531563077349587"},{"author_id":"8149482","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:48:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115531131873566909"],"id":"2115531131873566909","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11320,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"胡塞武装再次袭击亚丁机场 https://t.co/jLHZuNoHJR","url":"https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2115531131873566909"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:30:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115526664772092053"],"id":"2115526664772092053","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18324,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":3},"text":"记者：“政府暗示阿拉斯加选民看不懂选票上的‘现任者’一词，因而不知道该投票给萨利文参议员，阿拉斯加人难道不该觉得这是一种冒犯吗？”万斯：“人们很忙。人们有生活。人们有工作。”","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2115526664772092053"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115526515895193792"],"id":"2115526515895193792","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":51889,"like_count":119,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":10},"text":"10月28日，广东广州：中铁二局集团有限公司广州白云新型储能产业园（一期）项目因拖欠工程款，多名维权人员驾驶车辆将项目部大门围堵。发帖人称该项目的大楼均已封顶，但工程款却迟迟未支付。 https://t.co/wosHKM3KcU","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115526515895193792"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:24:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115525098132385903"],"id":"2115525098132385903","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":10039,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"text":"OpenAI抛出对400个数学问题的证明，真假不知，在国际数学界引起了很大风波，陶哲轩率领一批著名数学家抗议这种做法。而中国数学家却对此感到欢欣鼓舞。方舟子时评：人工智能要颠覆数学研究了吗？\nhttps://t.co/JIuw8w6hY8","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2115525098132385903"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:15:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115522887926890800"],"id":"2115522887926890800","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":19423,"like_count":70,"quote_count":13,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":3},"text":"讨厌 AI 味也是一种洁癖\n\n工业时代了没必要太追求手工制品，还是看产品有没有价值，质量是不是够好 https://t.co/G1l0KhKGbx","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2115522887926890800"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115518968874086537"],"id":"2115518968874086537","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":76,"impression_count":84703,"like_count":629,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":56,"retweet_count":55},"text":"出租车司机称开一天只挣几十元、养不住家：“我恨透了这个世界”\n\n10月26日，一名出租车司机在抖音发布视频称，自己开一天出租车只能挣几十块钱，养不住家。他说：“这一刻，我恨透了这个世界。”\n\n视频弹幕中，网友留言：\n“祥子到死都认为是自己不够努力”\n“在自己身上找原因，为什么一天不开48小时呢” https://t.co/t3HSN61PjS","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115518968874086537"},{"author_id":"1669276256","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:55:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115517927730606478"],"id":"2115517927730606478","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":20051,"like_count":37,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":47,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我去，谷歌是咋了？这分数对吗？\n\n他们又发布了一个 Gemini 4 模型，叫Gemini 4 Carbon。\n\n在所有的测评上几乎都超过了 Fable 5.1 和 Opus 5.5\n\nTerminal bench 4.0 比其他几个模型高了非常多。 https://t.co/7oFPGGDDrs","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2115517927730606478"},{"author_id":"902926941413453824","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:51:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115515628023099863","2115516716331536682"],"id":"2115516716331536682","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":763,"impression_count":820410,"like_count":10315,"quote_count":239,"reply_count":896,"retweet_count":1328},"text":"Do NOT click links in emails.\nDo NOT download attachments.\n\nEven from people you trust, they may unknowningly have a virus on their computer.","url":"https://x.com/cz_binance/status/2115516716331536682"},{"author_id":"902926941413453824","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:46:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115515628023099863","2115516716331536682"],"id":"2115515628023099863","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":174486,"like_count":359,"quote_count":14,"reply_count":126,"retweet_count":36},"text":"Do NOT click links in emails.\nDo NOT download attachments.\n\nEven from people you trust, they may unknowning have a virus on their computer end.","url":"https://x.com/cz_binance/status/2115515628023099863"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:46:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115515523391783005"],"id":"2115515523391783005","lang":"zh","publi