status/2115508498607833290"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:08:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115505947187585302"],"id":"2115505947187585302","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":372,"impression_count":43606,"like_count":293,"quote_count":11,"reply_count":59,"retweet_count":37},"text":"如果你在用 Claude Code 的话，再推荐下记得运行下 /autocompact 300k \n（原推是400k，我自己用下来300k就足够了，当然选哪个你可以自己决定）\n\n自动压缩（Auto-compact）的作用是将整段长对话精简为简短的摘要，而不是一直保留上百万的完整历史记录。在 1M 上下文模型中，系统默认要到约 967K Token https://t.co/RfDVtYBnjR","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2115505947187585302"},{"author_id":"20845447","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:03:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115504835395244066"],"id":"2115504835395244066","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4198,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"支持朝鲜融资网络？华盛顿予以制裁 rfi.​my/DAeg https://t.co/Mc0nV9u1hy","url":"https://x.com/RFI_Cn/status/2115504835395244066"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115503864916885857"],"id":"2115503864916885857","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":52349,"like_count":182,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":14},"text":"10月28日，辽宁省营口大石桥市“中建镁砖”职工因公司长期拖欠工资及社保，前往当地市政府门前集会讨薪维权。  \n\n视频显示，大批职工聚集在市政府门前广场，现场有大批警察、特警排成长队进行戒备维稳。 \n据职工发帖介绍，公司已拖欠员工工资长达15个月，断缴社保19个月。 https://t.co/Pk9xxtf9vL","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115503864916885857"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-28T17:36:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115497857054605821"],"id":"2115497857054605821","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":20,"impression_count":65831,"like_count":235,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":52,"retweet_count":7},"text":"想起一句话：“当初求种像条狗，如今撸完嫌人丑” 😂 https://t.co/DFTtO3T97b","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2115497857054605821"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T17:30:00.000Z","edit_history_t